---
# The shop's contact card, /book/bc-glass-and-tint.vcf (peak pass R1, psychology 5). The request
# success panel (_includes/v3/request.njk) and /book/sent/ link to it as "Add to contacts", so the
# shop's callback shows a name instead of an unknown number. Every value comes from _data/site.json
# (name, phone, address, site URL). The business only: no personal data. vCard 3.0 (RFC 2426) with
# CRLF line ends (the "\r\n" below; the repo stores LF). Not in collections, so not in the sitemap.
# A value with a comma or semicolon must be escaped as \, or \; (none today).
permalink: book/bc-glass-and-tint.vcf
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{%- set NL = "\r\n" -%}
{%- set a = site.address -%}
BEGIN:VCARD{{ NL }}VERSION:3.0{{ NL }}N:;;;;{{ NL }}FN:{{ site.name | safe }}{{ NL }}ORG:{{ site.name | safe }}{{ NL }}X-ABShowAs:COMPANY{{ NL }}TEL;TYPE=WORK,VOICE:{{ site.phone.tel | safe }}{{ NL }}ADR;TYPE=WORK:;;{{ a.street | safe }};{{ a.city | safe }};{{ a.region | safe }};{{ a.postal_code | safe }};{{ a.country | safe }}{{ NL }}URL:{{ site.url | safe }}{{ NL }}END:VCARD{{ NL -}}
